  "description": "NEW TO THE MARKET\nLisatava, Hollymount, Co. Mayo\nF12 A6P0\nCharming 2 Bedroom Two-Storey Country Residence on c.0.35 Acre Site\n\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers are delighted to bring to the market this attractive two-bedroom two-storey residence situated in the peaceful village of Lisatava, Hollymount, Co. Mayo.\n\nSet on a generous c.0.35 acre site, this property offers an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, investors or those seeking a countryside home with huge potential. \n\nWhile the property would benefit from modernisation and redecoration, it provides a solid foundation for creating a wonderful family home.\n\nAccommodation\nGround Floor\nLiving room\nKitchen\nUtility room\nBathroom\nPatio area\nStorage shed\nFirst Floor\nLanding\nTwo spacious double bedrooms\n\nOutside\nThe property enjoys a driveway to the side together with a rear yard and garden, providing excellent outdoor space and plenty of potential for further landscaping.\n\nGeneral\nc.0.35 Acre Site\nPiped Water\nElectricity Connected\nTelephone & Broadband Available\nQuiet Village Setting\nProperty in Need of Refurbishment & Redecoration\nExcellent Potential to Create a Charming Family Home\n\nLocation\nIdeally located in the village of Lisatava, close to Hollymount and within easy reach of Claremorris, Ballinrobe and Ireland West Airport Knock.\n\nGuide Price: Offers in Excess of €150,000\n\nViewing comes highly recommended and is strictly by appointment only with the sole selling agents.\n\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers\nMIPAV MMCEPI\nPSRA Licence No. 002031\n\nRoscommon Office: 086 2130723\nClaremorris Office: 094 9362216\nEmail: nigeldineenauctioneer@gmail.com\nEmail: enquiries@finnauctioneers.com\n\nEverything we touch turns to SOLD\n\nDisclaimer: These particulars, including measurements, floor areas and property size, are for guidance only and may contain errors. They do not form part of any contract. Intending purchasers should satisfy themselves as to the accuracy of all information provided.",
